Package: lfc
Type: Package
Title: Log Fold Change Distribution Tools for Working with Ratios of Counts
Version: 0.2.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Florian", "Erhard", email = "Florian.Erhard@informatik.uni-regensburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3574-6983"))
    )
Description: Ratios of count data such as obtained from RNA-seq are modelled
    using Bayesian statistics to derive posteriors for effects sizes. This
    approach is described in Erhard & Zimmer (2015) <doi:10.1093/nar/gkv696> 
    and Erhard (2018) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/bty471>.
